			"SHA": "804669f15eefffeac934b93ef927e9418330c822"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-07T19:00:02Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				684,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement vscode-file:// protocol handler\n\nAdd a custom URI scheme protocol handler for `vscode-file://` URLs used by VS Code's Electron workbench to load frontend assets.\n\nThe handler maps URLs like `vscode-file://vscode-app/Static/Application/out/vs/workbench/...` to embedded assets in the Sky/Target directory, stripping the `/out/` prefix since assets are stored at `/Static/Application/vs/`.\n\nIncludes MIME type detection based on file extension and sets appropriate caching headers (1 year immutable) for performance.\n\nThis enables the embedded frontend bundle to be served correctly when VS Code platform code requests assets via the custom protocol.",
			"SHA": "b471ab12e1ab040a4e5ac0e4fdffc0be89be03ec"
		}
	],
